title: A question of the app (here before deleting a file) dims what is behind it but hides no page: an extension's page beside it stays in sight, only the question's own box is cut out of what it covers
folders: rust-small
extensions: webview-extension
limit: 80
expect-log: script: Answer
forbid-log: a page goes out of sight
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
right qa.chat
wait 3000
mark a-page-open
wait 500
delete src/lib.rs
wait 1500
mark b-question-over-the-pages
wait 500
answer Cancel
wait 1200
mark c-question-gone
wait 500
quit
